 and injectable GLP 1s and hormone replacement therapy. In addition, it licenses its trademarks and other intellectual property in food, beverages, and other weight management-relevant consumer products and services, as well as provides publishing services. The company was formerly known as Weight Watchers International, Inc. and changed its name to WW International, Inc. in September 2019. WW International, Inc. was founded in 1963 and is headquartered in New York, New York.","desc_src":"Yahoo Finance profile via yfinance (third-party)","sic":"7200","sic_desc":"Services-Personal Services","sector":"Healthcare","industry":"Medical Care Facilities","mcap":148681568,"mcap_src":"Yahoo Finance profile (third-party, cached)","hq":"NEW YORK, NY","fy_end":"1231","cik":105319,"state_inc":"VA","massive_note":"Massive ticker details not fetched yet (5 calls/min limit; filled in on a nightly run)","sec_asof":"2026-10-06"},"fin":{"available":true,"src":"SEC EDGAR XBRL companyfacts","asof":"2026-10-06","q":[{"end":"2023-07-01","rev":226830000.0,"rev_yoy":-15.8,"eps":0.65,"eps_yoy":"turned +","ni":50828000.0,"ni_yoy":"turned +","nm":22.4,"derived":null,"fp":null},{"end":"2023-09-30","rev":214871000.0,"rev_yoy":-14.0,"eps":0.54,"eps_yoy":"turned +","ni":43731000.0,"ni_yoy":"turned +","nm":20.4,"derived":null,"fp":null},{"end":"2023-12-30","rev":205955000.0,"rev_yoy":-7.6,"eps":-1.11,"eps_yoy":-117.6,"ni":-88135000.0,"ni_yoy":-146.3,"nm":-42.8,"derived":null,"fp":null},{"end":"2024-03-30","rev":206548000.0,"rev_yoy":-14.6,"eps":-4.39,"eps_yoy":-161.3,"ni":-347902000.0,"ni_yoy":-193.1,"nm":-168.4,"derived":null,"fp":null},{"end":"2024-06-29","rev":202073000.0,"rev_yoy":-10.9,"eps":0.29,"eps_yoy":-55.4,"ni":23269000.0,"ni_yoy":-54.2,"nm":11.5,"derived":null,"fp":null},{"end":"2024-09-28","rev":192887000.0,"rev_yoy":-10.2,"eps":-0.58,"eps_yoy":-207.4,"ni":-46192000.0,"ni_yoy":-205.6,"nm":-23.9,"derived":null,"fp":null},{"end":"2024-12-28","rev":184413000.0,"rev_yoy":-10.5,"eps":0.33,"